# A landscape fullscreen app run turned on the PDA profile (report 038 S2, report 041, 042): Settings > System >
# Keyboard test with its Text field focused shows the band (vkb=zone); while the app is in front it owns the whole panel
# in landscape (its own display backend at rotate 0, 800x480 or 640x480: no writing zone, no key strip) and its keyboard
# rule is the usual one (input.state vkb=auto: a physical keyboard first, else its own keyboard); when the launcher takes
# the panel back the field still edits, so the band is drawn again and the zone is the text input again (vkb=zone). The
# app's frame is a test picture drawn into the framebuffer as the app would (the portrait shot shows it sideways).
# Goldens at both sizes.
title zone turned
sizes 480x640 480x800
profile pda
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 1
apps Settings CLI SSH Calculator "Mesh Hop=ip_panel_100.png" "RSS Reader=fixture:store_100.png"
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
launch Settings
key UP
key ENTER
key UP
key UP
key UP
key ENTER
expect_zone shown
expect_vkb zone
shot zone_turned_text
turnedapp on
expect_vkb auto
expect_hand 1
expect_fb paused
shot zone_turned
turnedapp off
expect_zone shown
expect_vkb zone
expect_same zone_turned_text
